- !<ScriptComponent/a4843a9f-7732-4607-8028-cd32a0bd7461>
  PrefabRemaps:
    []
  Name: ExampleCarousel
  Enabled: true
  ScriptAsset: !<reference> 31b7a776-6307-56e5-b0ae-dc1ecd373eeb
  ScriptInputsDefault:
    stepInfo: true
    startIndex: true
    previousLabel: true
    nextLabel: true
    examplesPushBack: true
    anchorExamples: true
    startMinimized: true
  ScriptTypesDefault:
    {}
  ScriptInputs:
    "":
      examples: !<reference.SceneObject[]>
        - !<reference> df27c048-6155-4efc-ab6a-c77f785e876f
        - !<reference> 8850d762-6e9f-4a9c-aa7a-42d2ea359495
        - !<reference> 8e47563e-9572-4a91-8884-23931be633ef
        - !<reference> 3d7de1b0-154e-40f1-a90b-f86bdf0cccd5
        - !<reference> 8ac53fb5-88e5-46d6-ad1d-19d13f9e2085
        - !<reference> d341eab7-30ad-4e83-b201-820d28f4db12
        - !<reference> 877ee8b5-9a34-49c0-bf10-c9ae502cdd72
        - !<reference> 7fb851bf-8d7c-420f-801d-b644c0a2f54c
        - !<reference> be7348d5-41b8-48a7-8554-0214a4011235
        - !<reference> 6e1aa030-6c05-49ee-8d16-e900e610d5b2
        - !<reference> 5ed41b99-c817-42d6-9ba5-dc631d9ec683
        - !<reference> 9c30a8df-38cc-455a-a466-c8cb5e76e999
        - !<reference> 454aad2f-9b21-45c8-9caa-dc3608f2d085
        - !<reference> 3a222a2b-88aa-43a7-adef-ac1a9f457a53
      exampleInfo: !<string[]>
        - "Interaction Kit and UI Kit working together: an interactive showcase with near and far panel placement and a showcase selector. Pinch a panel to bring it closer or move it away, and switch showcases from the selector."
        - "Makes any object interactable. Pinch or poke the objects to trigger hover, press and release events and see the feedback."
        - "Calls functions on other scripts from interaction events, without writing glue code. Press the buttons to fire each call."
        - "Solvers keep content placed relative to the user. Here they play in third person: the Head pose cube moves on its own and each solver reacts to it. Examples change every few seconds."
        - "Reads and changes components on objects and their children, from TypeScript and JavaScript. The Log panel shows what each script found; use Next to step through the examples."
        - "Spawns objects at runtime: on circles, lines, grids, and random points in boxes and spheres. Each layout is generated when the example starts."
        - "Attaches objects to hand joints with offset, rotation and smoothing. Raise your hands to see the objects follow the configured joints."
        - "Draws lines, polylines, splines, spirals and circles between objects every frame. Grab a control point to reshape the gizmo."
        - "Places content on tables, floors and walls. Tabletop: lay a palm flat on a table and hold it still while the ring fills. Ground and Wall: look at the surface and hold your view steady. Use Next to change mode."
        - Drag the grey cube. The white sphere snaps onto the cyan line and the orange one onto the blue plane when the cube comes within 4 cm; a snapped sphere turns green.
        - "A ray is cast from your head along your gaze. Look at the box: the red dot lands where the ray hits, and the line below says what it hit and how far away."
        - Physics collisions and a soft press interaction. Push the objects with your hand to trigger collision and press events.
        - "Six custom visuals for UI Kit buttons, each a RoundedRectangleVisual style per state: glass, accent, outline, gradient, lift and toggle. Hover and press each card."
        - "Small focused demos: archery, drag and drop, raycast painting, dot product, 3D panels and more. Enable a demo and try it in place."
      steps: !<reference.SceneObject[]>
        - !<reference> df27c048-6155-4efc-ab6a-c77f785e876f
        - !<reference> 8850d762-6e9f-4a9c-aa7a-42d2ea359495
